Today I solved leetcode question 1037:Valid Boomerang.

Description: It states that we wre given an array with 3 pairs.
              We can consider them points and we must return true if they do not make a straight line.
              Else we must return false.

Solution: So to check whether the points make a straight line or not we must first check the slope made by them.
          First we will find slope of first 2 points then of next two points.
          And if both slopes are equal we will return false.
          Else we will return true.
